        rdfs:comment                   "Ground divided into vertical stripes; broad bands of dark brown ground having powder of floral sprigs and sprays of roses and marguerites arranged diagonally; narrow vertical stripes stimulating lace edged ribbons shaded from deep brownish red center out to yellow edge, and having diagonal serrated long leaves encircling them; design printed in reds, bluish green, blue and black; extra piece for duplicate collection.  (Design also printed in yellow)"@en ;
